```json
[{"t":{"0":"t0"},"c":{"0":[]}},{"d":[1]},{"d":[3]}]
```

After hydration and one click on "toggle", the content of `<app-container>` is `<div></div>`. Without `provideClientHydration()`, it is `<div>projected text</div>`.

The console of the development build only has:

```
